# Put the cube held after PickCube down at (x, y) on the table, or on top of another cube.
# Phases (feedback.phase): carry, refine (stacking only), descend, release, retreat.

# Goal
float64 x                 # base_link [m], cube centre; ignored when on_cube_id is set
float64 y
string on_cube_id         # empty: on the table; else stack on that cube (seen by the camera)
float64 yaw_deg           # cube yaw on the table [deg]; NaN: any (smallest wrist roll change)
---
# Result
bool success
string message
string failed_phase
geometry_msgs/Point placed_position   # base_link, where the cube centre was released
---
# Feedback
string phase
string detail
